            ^"Bonds" LIST OF #L5R262wX4yZ6aB8cD0eF2g ^"Bond" [#CyrnYiMyZEIYWW6UWAi5LT ^"Lover Bond"]
            ^"Equipment" LIST OF STRING ["Lacquered Armor", "Traveling Clothes", "Katana", "Wakizashi", "Tetsubō", "Horsebow", "Gunbai", "Traveling pack", "Finger of Jade", "Ceremonial Clothes", "Three Victories", "Scroll of Battle Tactics", "400 zeni"]
            ^"Bushido" DEF { ^"Paramount Tenet" STRING "Courage" ^"Less Significant Tenet" STRING "Courtesy" }
            ^"Experience" INTEGER 103
            ^"Experience Spent" INTEGER 103
            ^"Experience Ledger" LIST OF STRING ["3 · Beseech Hida's Might · rank 1", "3 · Battle of No Escape · rank 1", "3 · Soaring Slice · rank 1", "3 · Striking as Fire · rank 1", "3 · Warrior’s Resolve · rank 1", "3 · Striking as Earth · rank 1", "2 · Courtesy +1 (0 -> 1) · rank 1", "9 · Void +1 (2 -> 3) · rank 2", "9 · Fire +1 (2 -> 3) · rank 2", "4 · Martial Arts [Melee] +1 (1 -> 2) · rank 2", "6 · Martial Arts [Melee] +1 (2 -> 3) · rank 2", "3 · Great Anvil's Measure · rank 2", "3 · Beseech Shiba's Calm · rank 2", "16 · Renowned Warrior · rank 3", "3 · Behold the Legend · rank 3", "3 · The Patient Viper · rank 3", "3 · Beseech Akodo's Judgment · rank 3", "6 · Command +1 (2 -> 3) · rank 3", "9 · Earth +1 (2 -> 3) · rank 3", "6 · Tactics +1 (2 -> 3) · rank 3", "3 · Piercing Bolt Style · rank 3"]
            ^"Stance" STRING "Void"
            ^"Notes" STRING "Harunobu’s Core ResponsibilitiesStrategic Commander in Utaku Kamoko’s Forces\nCommands a specialized force within the Unicorn army, focusing on long-term campaign planning and battlefield logistics.\nDirects defensive operations when Kamoko’s usual fast-strike tactics need reinforcement.\nTrusted to lead forces independently when Kamoko must focus elsewhere.\nKamoko’s Personal Advisor\nOne of the few people Kamoko trusts to challenge her ideas without undermining her authority.\nOffers alternative strategies when pure cavalry charges won’t work.\nHelps Kamoko anticipate enemy movements, particularly against foes like the Lion and Scorpion, who rely on deception and layered tactics.\nCrab Clan Liaison\nHandles military negotiations between the Unicorn and Crab, ensuring both sides coordinate effectively in shared operations.\nRespected by Crab commanders, even if they see him as too soft for having returned to the Unicorn.\nActs as a buffer when Unicorn cavalry tactics clash with the Crab’s fortification and attrition warfare strategies.\nEnsures that Unicorn supply lines remain open when dealing with the often blunt and inflexible Hida.\nHow This Affects His Relationship with Doji SetsunaAlways in military councils, rarely in court.\nHarunobu is busy with Kamoko’s campaigns and dealing with the Crab, meaning he is almost never around Setsuna for long.\nHe doesn’t see court politics as an active threat because his world is the battlefield—leaving Setsuna to fight battles he doesn’t realize exist.\nKamoko trusts him, but Setsuna protects him.\nKamoko respects his loyalty and intellect, but doesn’t concern herself with his political vulnerabilities.\nSetsuna, however, is likely protecting Harunobu from courtly enemies without him even realizing it."
            ^"As Recorded" LIST OF STRING ["Doji Setsuna"]
        }
    }

